dmonton's west end, this 3rd-floor condo offers secure, low-maintenance living in a quiet area close to amenities, with features well suited to the 55+ buyer. Located down the hall from the elevators, the home offers added privacy. New flooring throughout adds a fresh, polished feel, while the welcoming central entry provides convenient access to the laundry/storage room. The spacious kitchen has room for an eating bar or island and flows into generous dining and living areas. The living room opens to a large, covered, sheltered west-facing balcony looking onto treed area—an inviting spot to unwind. Two bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned beside the 3-piece main bath, each offering natural light and flexibility. The primary bedroom features built-in closet organizers and a 4-piece ensuite. Abundant closet storage, secure underground parking and a lockable storage cage add convenience. Heat, water & sewer are included, with professional management and a main-floor common area. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$185,000"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","895 sq ft"],["Year built","1992"],["Condo fee","$545 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Terra Losa"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5T5Z5"],["MLS® number","E4505697"],["Listed","August 27, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat"],["Parking","Indoor"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.20 m × 3.35 m (10'6\" × 11'0\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.63 m × 3.33 m (8'8\" × 10'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.54 m × 2.99 m (11'7\" × 9'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.43 m × 3.84 m (14'6\" × 12'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.53 m × 4.12 m (11'7\" × 13'6\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","1.71 m × 3.33 m (5'7\" × 10'11\")"]],"courtesy":"John Connor, RE/MAX Excellence","